    "description": "<p>You begin to generate a surge of twisted medical release chakra designed to tear open wounds and rend the flesh.</p>\n<p>Make a range ninjutsu attack against a creature you can see. On a hit, you deal 3d10 necrotic damage and forces them to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save they gain 1 rank of Bleed.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the damage by 1d10 and the ranks of Bleed inflicted by +1.</p>",
